<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center;"><font size="2" style="" face="Arial, sans-serif"><img src="https://qantas--c.ap1.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0159000000FSVkd&amp;oid=00D900000010OOK&amp;lastMod=1521233610000" alt="Logo"></font></p><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);" face="Arial, sans-serif"><br><br></font><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif">Ref No: {!Case.CaseNumber}</font></p><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);" face="Arial, sans-serif"><br><br></font><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif">Dear {!Case.First_Name__c},</font></p><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);" face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif">Thank
you for contacting us about your journey to {!Case.Arrival_City__c} on
{!Case.TECH_Arrival_Date__c}.</font></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 7.5pt; line-height: normal;"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);">We understand how inconvenient schedule
changes are and know how important it is to advise you straight away when
timetable changes occur, so you can adjust your plans accordingly.</span><o:p></o:p></font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 7.5pt; line-height: normal;"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif"><b><i><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);">-If notified by QF use:-</span></i></b><o:p></o:p></font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 7.5pt; line-height: normal;"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);">I can see that an email was sent to you on {!Case.TECH_Email_Arrival_Date_Time__c}
advising you of the change.</span><o:p></o:p></font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 7.5pt; line-height: normal;"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif"><b><i><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);">-If requesting compensation&nbsp;and has been
notified add:-</span></i></b><o:p></o:p></font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 7.5pt; line-height: normal;"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);">We are unable to meet your request for&nbsp;<b><i>-a
refund of your accommodation/compensation etc-</i></b>. What I can do is send
you a letter confirming the schedule change, if this will help you make a claim
through any travel insurance policies you hold. Please let me know if you would
like this letter.</span><o:p></o:p></font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 7.5pt; line-height: normal;"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif"><b><i><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);">-If QF did not advise of change use:-</span></i></b><o:p></o:p></font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 7.5pt; line-height: normal;"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);">I was concerned to learn that we didn’t get in
contact with you about this change and would like to apologise for the
oversight, on behalf of Qantas.</span><o:p></o:p></font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 7.5pt; line-height: normal;"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif"><b><i><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);">-If Agent did not advise of change use:-</span></i></b><o:p></o:p></font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 7.5pt; line-height: normal;"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);">I was concerned to learn that your travel
agent didn’t contact you about this change and regret the impact this had on
your planned itinerary.</span><o:p></o:p></font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 7.5pt; line-height: normal;"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);">When a flight is schedule changed prior to the
day of departure, notification is sent to the office who originally issued the
ticket to contact the customer, as the issuing agent is the only office able to
make changes to the ticket at this time. I can see that the schedule change
notification was sent through to<b><i>&nbsp;-your travel agent/British
Airways/American Airlines etc-</i></b>&nbsp;on&nbsp;<b>DATE</b>, so you will
need to contact them regarding any out of pocket expenses you had due to the
change.</span><o:p></o:p></font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 7.5pt; line-height: normal;"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif"><b><i><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);">-If expenses add:-</span></i></b><o:p></o:p></font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 7.5pt; line-height: normal;"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);">I am sorry to hear about the impact this had
on your planned itinerary and would be happy to look at the unexpected&nbsp;<b><i>-taxi/accommodation/other-</i>&nbsp;</b>cost
for you. I have attached a form for you to provide your bank account details,
so that we can process any refund. When returning the completed form and
supporting documentation, please reply to this email to ensure your information
is attached to your file and actioned accordingly.</span><o:p></o:p></font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 7.5pt; line-height: normal;"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif"><b><i><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);">-If wants to know why add:-</span></i></b><o:p></o:p></font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 7.5pt; line-height: normal;"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);">Scheduling is affected by a huge variety of
operational factors such as planned and unplanned aircraft maintenance,
commercial viability of routes, seasonal adjustments, special events and
changes to codeshare arrangements with our partners. As each aircraft in our
fleet operates across multiple routes, and any change can have a follow-on
effect across our entire network, it is not always possible to identify a
specific reason for each schedule change.&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 7.5pt; line-height: normal;"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif"><b><i><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);">-If providing goodwill gesture use:-</span></i></b><o:p></o:p></font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 7.5pt; line-height: normal;"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif"><b><i><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);">-If a Frequent Flyer:-</span></i></b><o:p></o:p></font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 7.5pt; line-height: normal;"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);">As a gesture of goodwill, I have credited {!Case.Recovery_Quantity__c}
Qantas Points to your Frequent Flyer account. You can use the points towards
flights, the purchase of food and wine through Qantas Wine, or a range of
products from our online Qantas Store.</span><o:p></o:p></font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 7.5pt; line-height: normal;"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif"><b><i><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);">-If not a Frequent Flyer:-</span></i></b><o:p></o:p></font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 7.5pt; line-height: normal;"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);">As a gesture of goodwill, I would like to
arrange a credit of {!Case.Recovery_Quantity__c} Qantas Points to you. You can
use the points towards flights, the purchase of food and wine through Qantas
Wine, or a range of products from our online Qantas Store.</span><o:p></o:p></font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 7.5pt; line-height: normal;"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);">Please advise us of your Frequent Flyer number
by replying to this email, so we can credit points to your account. If you are
not already a member, you can join free of charge via our website at
www.qantas.com/ccarecompmembership</span><o:p></o:p></font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 7.5pt; line-height: normal;"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);">I have also let our Contact Centre Management
know what happened, so they can look in to their notification processes and
make the necessary improvements.</span><o:p></o:p></font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 7.5pt; line-height: normal;"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif"><font style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);">We are grateful you took the time to write and
hope that we can welcome you on board again in the future.<br></span></font><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br><br>Kind regards<br></span><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br>{!User.FirstName}<br></span><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br>Qantas Customer Care<br></span><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br><img src="https://qantas--c.ap1.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0159000000FSVke&amp;oid=00D900000010OOK&amp;lastMod=1521233610000" alt="Qantas_Logo"><br></span><span style="text-align: center;"><br></span></font></p><div style="text-align: center;"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif">{!Case.Thread_Token}</font></span></div><p style=""></p><font size="2" style="" face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center;"><div style="text-align: center;">Qantas Airways Limited, ABN 16 009 661 901</div></span><span style="text-align: center;"><div style="text-align: center;">10 Bourke Road Mascot NSW 2020 Australia&nbsp;</div><div style="text-align: center;"><br></div><div style="text-align: center;"><p style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="text-align: left; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">***************************** PLEASE CONSIDER OUR ENVIRONMENT BEFORE PRINTING *****************************&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p style="font-family: arial; font-size: 16px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="1" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="text-align: left;">*********************************************** Confidentiality and Privilege Notice **********************************************&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></font></p><p style="font-family: arial; font-size: 16px; text-align: start;"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">This e-mail is intended only to be read or used by the addressee. It is confidential and may contain legally privileged information. If you are not the addressee indicated in this message (or responsible for delivery of the message to such person), you may not copy or deliver this message to anyone, and you should destroy this message and kindly notify the sender by reply e-mail. Confidentiality and legal privilege are not waived or lost by</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">reason of mistaken delivery to you. Qantas Airways Limited ABN 16 009 661 901&nbsp;</span></p><p style="font-family: arial; font-size: 16px; text-align: start;"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">***************************************************************************************************************************************</span></p></div></span></font><p style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"></p><p style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"></p>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>